{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20111","headline":"送草书献上人归庐山 · 孟郊","name":"送草书献上人归庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狂僧不爲酒，狂笔自通天。\n将书云霞片，直至清明巅。\n手中飞黑电，象外泻玄泉。\n万物随指顾，三光爲回旋。\n聚书云霮䨴，洗砚山晴鲜。\n忽怒画虵虺，喷然生风烟。\n江人愿停笔，惊浪恐倾船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}